vyāttānanaṁ dīpta-viśāla-netram
dṛṣṭvā hi tvāṁ pravyathitāntar-ātmā
dhṛtiṁ na vindāmi śamaṁ ca viṣṇo\"}]},{\"section\":\"synonyms\",\"section_title\":\"Books.Verse.synonyms\",\"children\":[{\"type\":\"books.Synonyms\",\"title\":\"synonyms\",\"id\":3264,\"bb\":2879,\"url_path\":\"/en/library/bg/11/24/b2879/\",\"shadow_value\":\"nabhaḥ-spṛśam – touching the sky; dīptam – glowing; aneka – many; varṇam – colors; vyātta – open; ānanam – mouths; dīpta – glowing; viśāla – very great; netram – eyes; dṛṣṭvā – seeing; hi – certainly; tvām – You; pravyathita – perturbed; antaḥ – within; ātmā – soul; dhṛtim – steadiness; na – not; vindāmi – I have; śamam – mental tranquillity; ca – also; viṣṇo – O Lord Viṣṇu.\",\"word_for_word_value\":[{\"word\":\"nabhaḥ-spṛśam\",\"translation\":\"touching the sky\"},{\"word\":\"dīptam\",\"translation\":\"glowing\"},{\"word\":\"aneka\",\"translation\":\"many\"},{\"word\":\"varṇam\",\"translation\":\"colors\"},{\"word\":\"vyātta\",\"translation\":\"open\"},{\"word\":\"ānanam\",\"translation\":\"mouths\"},{\"word\":\"dīpta\",\"translation\":\"glowing\"},{\"word\":\"viśāla\",\"translation\":\"very great\"},{\"word\":\"netram\",\"translation\":\"eyes\"},{\"word\":\"dṛṣṭvā\",\"translation\":\"seeing\"},{\"word\":\"hi\",\"translation\":\"certainly\"},{\"word\":\"tvām\",\"translation\":\"You\"},{\"word\":\"pravyathita\",\"translation\":\"perturbed\"},{\"word\":\"antaḥ\",\"translation\":\"within\"},{\"word\":\"ātmā\",\"translation\":\"soul\"},{\"word\":\"dhṛtim\",\"translation\":\"steadiness\"},{\"word\":\"na\",\"translation\":\"not\"},{\"word\":\"vindāmi\",\"translation\":\"I have\"},{\"word\":\"śamam\",\"translation\":\"mental tranquillity\"},{\"word\":\"ca\",\"translation\":\"also\"},{\"word\":\"viṣṇo\",\"translation\":\"O Lord Viṣṇu\"}]}]},{\"section\":\"translation\",\"section_title\":\"Books.Verse.translation\",\"children\":[{\"type\":\"content.Record\",\"title\":\"translation\",\"id\":3265,\"bb\":2880,\"url_path\":\"/en/library/bg/11/24/b2880/\",\"body_value\":\"O all-pervading Viṣṇu, seeing You with Your many r